      <h2 id="managed-title">Managed job search<br>& applications</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="service-detail-copy reveal">
      <p class="service-lead">Spend less time repeating the same searches and more time preparing for the right conversations.</p>
      <h3>How the support works</h3>
      <ul class="plain-list">
        <li>Agree on roles, locations, working arrangements, and priorities</li>
        <li>Search relevant platforms and employer career pages</li>
        <li>Prepare and submit applications with clear authorization</li>
        <li>Maintain a visible application record</li>
        <li>Help coordinate recruiter communication and interview timing</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="service-boundary"><strong>You stay informed and in control.</strong> SWIX does not impersonate candidates, invent experience, or accept personal declarations on a candidate’s behalf.</p>
